&lt;p&gt;It is a code to check whether the path stored in the variable &apos;ZEPPELIN_NOTEBOOK_DIR&apos; exists, &lt;br/&gt;
and an error occurs because the variable itself does not exist.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Can you tell me how to change this code?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
